00:11:01,060 --> 00:11:03,020
 what my mentor once told me before,

271
00:11:03,020 --> 00:11:05,420
 that you don't have to learn

272
00:11:05,420 --> 00:11:06,460
 by way of your own experience.

273
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:08,260
 You can learn by way of someone else's experience.

274
00:11:08,260 --> 00:11:10,420
 That, in fact, can be your best teacher.

275
00:11:10,420 --> 00:11:12,980
 So with all that said, what's the first battle?

276
00:11:12,980 --> 00:11:16,460
 The first one is the battle of pride.

277
00:11:16,460 --> 00:11:17,340
 It's the battle of pride.

278
00:11:17,340 --> 00:11:19,740
 It's funny, I was thinking about this point.

279
00:11:19,740 --> 00:11:21,300
 And just yesterday, I was at the gym

280
