 and I was changing my clothes,

281
00:11:22,900 --> 00:11:23,940
 getting ready to go work out,

282
00:11:23,940 --> 00:11:26,460
 and I saw a group of high school guys

283
00:11:26,460 --> 00:11:27,960
 flexing in front of the mirror

284
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,460
 and taking pictures of themselves.

285
00:11:29,460 --> 00:11:30,500
 And I thought to myself,

286
00:11:30,500 --> 00:11:33,420
 that is the perfect definition of pride

287
00:11:33,420 --> 00:11:37,620
 because pride is less about self-exaltation.

288
00:11:37,620 --> 00:11:39,820
 It's more about self-absorption.

289
00:11:39,820 --> 00:11:41,060
 And then I proceeded to tell them

290
00:11:41,060 --> 00:11:43,900
 that shirtless selfies don't do anything

291
00:11:43,900 --> 00:11:44,860
 for the opposite sex.

292
00:11:44,860 --> 00:11:47,240
 So keep those to yourself, boys.

293
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:51,380
 Pride is less about self-exaltation.

294
00:11:51,380 --> 00:11:53,500
 It is more about self-absorption.

295
00:11:54,220 --> 00:11:55,860
 Another way of thinking about it

296
00:11:55,860 --> 00:11:57,620
 is it's not just thinking too much of yourself,

297
00:11:57,620 --> 00:11:59,920
 it's thinking of yourself too much.

298
00:11:59,920 --> 00:12:01,720
 It's why some of you guys,

299
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:04,140
 you're curious how well your post is doing,

300
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:05,640
 even though it was just five minutes ago

301
